  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-13T01:37:27Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Fix: root-cause why an interrupted reader-pool worker isn't reclaimed within its wait-queue deadline under full-suite timing/load, and fix the underlying race -- no rerun-to-green. Dispatched (reassigned to cipher) as BB-FLAKY-READER-POOL-1789288000, branch fix/bb-flaky-reader-pool cut from f0758be06, linked between fix/bb6-cli-qa2 and fix/bb6-docs-qa1 (PR #1474). Cipher's completion (2026-09-13T02:38:13Z) at @ 637c12263: root cause classified as harness wall-clock timing after interrupt, not a reclaim defect; test now waits for explicit reclamation metrics before reuse with a 5s bound, sibling reclaim bounds swept. Base exact test 50/50, pre-fix package under-load 50/50 locally, corrected test 200/200 under parallel workspace load. just lint 36/36, just test exit 0, parent f23d87928 an ancestor, worktree clean. Fixed-pending-QA at 637c12263." ;
